Package: directCarePlanner
Title: Direct Care Practice Launch Planner
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Anthony W.", "Raborn", , "anthony@raborndecisionsciences.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Golem-based Shiny app that wraps the directCarePlanR
    backend to help a physician plan a direct care practice launch:
    market context lookup, membership and fee revenue modeling,
    multi-scenario financial projections, capital requirements, and a
    downloadable PDF launch plan.
